{"duration_api_ms":102446,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"37e1dc3c-0c64-4646-a352-c769cfc4b65f","total_cost_usd":0.8204591999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":34,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59943,"cache_read_input_tokens":718696,"output_tokens":9852,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1023},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59943,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":769,"cache_read_input_tokens":61733,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4190,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4190},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":34,"outputTokens":9852,"cacheReadInputTokens":718696,"cacheCreationInputTokens":59943,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8204591999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1023,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01HcrPptB6iZ8vYodd4SfLVc","tool_input":{"command":"cd /Users/christoph/Privat/samples/wp68-java; P=src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product; cat -n $P/adapter/incoming/web/ProductPageController.java $P/adapter/incoming/web/ProductCatalogPageViewModel.java $P/application/getallproducts/GetAllProductsUseCase.java; cat -n src/main/resources/templates/product/catalog.pug; find src -name 'seed-catalogue.json'; grep -n -i 'seed\\|sort\\|compar' $P/adapter/incoming/bootstrap/SampleDataInitializer.java $P/adapter/outgoing/persistence/InMemoryProductRepository.java","description":"Read catalogue code path"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01UQyUwvqcdiyXzuSC3C3NZo","tool_input":{"command":"F=src/main/java/dev/domaincentric/sample/ecommerce/product/adapter/incoming/bootstrap/SampleDataInitializer.java; grep -c '^    createProduct(' $F; grep -n -A2 '^    createProduct(' $F | grep -v 'createProduct\\|--' | awk 'NR%2==0'; ls ../ 2>/dev/null; find .. -maxdepth 4 -name 'seed-catalogue.json' 2>/dev/null","description":"Count seeded products and locate seed JSON"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":23,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote the plan for CAT-01 to `tasks/CAT-01/plan.md`. It needs no human decision. I didn't run the gate, the build or any other stage.\n\nThe story is marked as adopted, meaning it describes behaviour the shop already has. So the plan changes no code and no existing tests; for each scenario it records where the behaviour lives and which test covers it.\n\n**Context:** the story belongs to `product`. The designed map and the one generated from the code agree on it, and the catalogue page already exists at `GET /products`.\n\n**Per scenario:**\n\n| Scenario | Level | Where it lives | Existing test |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `catalogue-lists-the-seeded-range` (happy path) | e2e | the seeding code in `SampleDataInitializer` creates 21 products | `SeededCatalogE2ETest.catalogListsTheSeededProductsInNameOrder` |\n| `catalogue-is-in-name-order` | integration | `InMemoryProductRepository` sorts by name | only the same e2e test, plus a unit test of the sort on its own sample data; no integration test |\n| `card-shows-name-description-and-image` | integration | `catalog.pug`, lines 16–23 | none |\n| `card-leads-to-the-product` | integration | `catalog.pug`, line 30 | none as such (`CookiePolicyTestBase` only finds one product link, as setup for a cookie check) |\n| `catalogue-page-heading` | integration | the page's view model, `layout.pug:7`, `catalog.pug:4-9` | none |\n\nThe test stage will need to add four integration tests.\n\n**One mismatch with the story:** the story says the catalogue is seeded from `seed-catalogue.json`, but there is no such file in this repository. The Java sample creates the 21 products in code. I planned on the reading that the file name refers to the catalogue shared between the samples, and listed this under open assumptions. If the story means this sample has to load that file, it isn't an adoption but a change, and the backlog should say so.\n\nThe profile names a knowledge skill (`dca-knowledge`), but I didn't use it because an adopt plan makes no architecture decisions. There's no glossary proposal.","ttft_ms":3710,"type":"result","duration_ms":103094,"uuid":"432e3276-913c-4190-b466-9fdfcf8d5fb5","ttft_stream_ms":2731,"time_to_request_ms":52,"first_content_frame_ms":2732,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
